 TAKEO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKAHASHI TERUNOBU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMAGUCHI MASAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AWASHIMA, HIROKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYOSHI, TAKEO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKAHASHI, TERUNOBU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAGUCHI, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>In a hermetic compressor using a hydrocarbon coolant and a mineral oil lubricant, the decrease in the viscosity of the mineral oil lubricant for the purpose of operation with high efficiency results in poor lubricity and the lowering of reliability.  In order to improve lubricity and to thereby achieve high efficiency, less noise and high reliability at the same time, at least one specific additive is added to a refrigerating machine oil.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Dans un compresseur hermétique utilisant un réfrigérant à base d'hydrocarbures et un lubrifiant à base d'huile minérale, la diminution de la viscosité du lubrifiant à base d'huile minérale pour permettre un fonctionnement à haut rendement entraîne une mauvaise lubrification et une baisse de la fiabilité. Afin d'améliorer la lubrification et permettre ainsi un rendement élevé, un bruit réduit et une fiabilité élevée dans le même temps, on ajoute au moins un additif spécifique à une huile de machine réfrigérante.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>